[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m  ⎿ 28 merged PRs across 6 repos\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.412, "o", "\u001b[0;37m● Reading the descriptions, not the diffs. A PR body here is the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;37m  as-built record, so the recap is mostly already written down.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.609, "o", "\u001b[38;5;110m● Bash\u001b[0m   gh pr view --json body,closingIssuesReferences \u001b[2m×28\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  ⎿ 15 issues closed · 10 filed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.611, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m╭─\u001b[0m \u001b[1;36mWho's reading this recap?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.308, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32m❯ 1. Teammates\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.311, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   2. Manager or lead\r\n"]
[0.311, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   3. Leadership\r\n"]
[0.306, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   4. Just me\r\n"]
[0.308, "o", "\u001b[2m╰─\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.119, "o", "\u001b[2m  → \"do two — one for teammates, one for leadership\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m     format: Slack · detail: Standard\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.011, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36m  For teammates\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.510, "o", "  *The prompts are instruction again, not their own history*\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Four trimming passes over the skills, then an audit for what they\r\n  missed: descriptions cut back to routing information, and\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  issue-workflow split along its create/resolve seam so a resolver\r\n  stops loading the half about filing.\r\n"]
[1.207, "o", "  The duplicated gh/jq/GraphQL blocks moved out of the skill prose\r\n  into scripts/. shellcheck covers scripts/ and covers nothing inside\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  a .md, so every one of those blocks was untested by construction.\r\n"]
[1.209, "o", "  \u001b[33mCaveat:\u001b[0m judged by reading. Nothing asserts a skill stays trimmed.\r\n"]
[1.807, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36m  For leadership\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.509, "o", "  *The workflow got cheaper to run and harder to contradict itself.*\r\n  Every session loads these prompts before it does any work, and they\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  had accumulated their own change history — text explaining why\r\n  something used to be different rather than instructing. Cutting it\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  means less read per session and fewer places for two instructions to\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  disagree. The shell the skills hand out now lives in real script\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  files, so it is linted and tested rather than copy-pasted prose.\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;37m  Same 28 PRs, same caveats. Different altitude.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.011, "x", "0"]
